    "key": "spell_summonerheal_tooltip",
    "value": "Restores <healing>@TotalHeal@ Health</healing> and grants <speed>@MoveSpeed*100@% Move Speed</speed> for @MoveSpeedDuration@ second to you and target allied champion.<br><br><rules>If cast without a target, it will cast on the most wounded allied champion in range.<br>Healing is halved on units recently affected by Summoner Heal.</rules>"
